license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/brazilfi"
url: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/brazilfi"
abstract: >-
  brazilfi is a unified Python SDK for Brazilian financial market APIs. It
  brings Bacen (SGS), IBGE (SIDRA), Tesouro Direto and B3 behind a single
  typed interface, returning Pydantic models and pandas DataFrames, and
  ships an integrated command-line interface.
keywords:
  - Python
  - SDK
  - Brazil
  - financial market
  - open data
  - Bacen
  - IBGE
  - Tesouro Direto
  - B3
  - SELIC
  - IPCA
  - time series
